```java
Map<String, Object> params = new LinkedHashMap<>();
params.put("campaignId", request.campaignId());
...
```

Or change fingerprint signature to accept varargs alternating key/value: `fingerprint("campaignId", x, "visitorId", y)`. Cleaner. Let me refactor: 

```java
private String fingerprint(Object... keyValues) {
    Map<String, Object> params = new LinkedHashMap<>();
    for (int i = 0; i < keyValues.length; i += 2) {
        params.put((String) keyValues[i], keyValues[i + 1]);
    }
    return writeJson(params);
}
```

And calls: fingerprint("campaignId", request.campaignId(), "dailyTotalCap", ..., "perVisitorDailyCap", ..., "creativeIds", creativeIds).

Let me update the service accordingly.

